# Project Structure Guide (Automit)
# This file provides a structural map of the project components.
## 📁 src/
# Contains the primary application logic and executable source code.
# - Core automation scripts and orchestration flow.
## 📁 lib/
# Holds reusable utility libraries, helpers, and foundational components.
# - Functions designed for general use across multiple modules.
## 📁 .agents/
# Runtime state storage and persistent agent context data.
# - Contains session history, user profiles, and current workflow snapshots.
# ⚠️ DO NOT EDIT MANUALLY. This directory is managed by the core application.
